%
% tseng2026catpaw and mcnutt2025linters were both published in the meantime
% and now carry publisher DOIs, verified like the rest: CHI 2026 through
% Crossref and the first author's publication page, and the January 2025 TVCG
% issue through Crossref, DBLP and a doi.org resolution to IEEE Xplore.
%
% petroff2021accessible has no *venue*: arXiv is the record, confirmed by the
% arXiv listing, the DataCite record and Petroff's DBLP page. Its DOI is
% arXiv's own, registered through DataCite, and resolves with a matching title
% and author. Drop it if the target venue objects to preprint DOIs.
%
% okabe2008cud is a web resource with no DOI or venue and so cannot be checked
% the same way. Its title, authors and dates are quoted from the page itself.
%
% larsson2025qualpal was checked twice. It first carried CRAN's auto-minted
